                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "238639328",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561199465429816",
                            "num_reviews": 133,
                            "playtime_forever": 56,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 56,
                            "last_played": 1792961572
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A game where you play as a witch and have to cook children but avoid their dads shooting at you. This game gets to be such a chaotic vibe, trying to snatch kids and avoid the bullets flying at you but I thought it was quite an enjoyable game. You only unlock the achievements as you complete the quests in game so you can only get three achievements per attempt you do in the game so it may take some time to get all 40 achievements. I love that you can knock out the parents shooting at you by dropping a child on their head. This is a brilliant game that I will be playing all year round. Give it a go if you like click and point games I find them a nice change after playing mouse and keyboard games.",
